+If you keep the existing DE/DE-family skeleton, you MUST change the actual mutation from `current-to-pbest/1` to a genuinely different operator:
+- `rand/1`:  `v = x_r1 + F * (x_r2 - x_r3)`
+- `rand/2`:  `v = x_r1 + F * (x_r2 - x_r3) + F * (x_r4 - x_r5)`
